{"eid": "js5_rag_04", "task": "rag", "cat": "trap", "recall5": null, "answer_f1": null, "trap_pass": false, "n_cands": 6, "n_ctx": 0, "answer": "要查詢Microsoft（微軟）的股息殖利率和歷年派息紀錄，需要訪問相關的金融數據庫或財報平台。以下是一些可能的來源和方法：\n\n### 股息殖利率\n股息殖利率是股息除以股價的比率，用來衡量投資者透過股息獲得的回報。可以在以下平台查詢：\n- **雅虎財經（Yahoo Finance）**：進入Microsoft的頁面，通常會顯示當前的股息殖利率。\n- **晨星（Morningstar）**：提供公司的股息歷史和殖利率分析。\n- **財報網站（如Seeking Alpha）**：有關注者分析的股息殖利率數據。\n\n### 歷年派息紀錄\n- **微軟官方財報**：微軟每年發布10-K和10-Q報告，其中包含股息分配的詳細信息。可以在美國證券交易委員會（SEC）的EDGAR數據庫中查詢。\n- **財經新聞網站**：如路透社、彭博社，會報導公司的派息公告。\n\n由於具體數據需要查詢最新的財報或金融平台，這裡無法提供即時的數據。建議訪問上述平台獲取準確的信息。\n\n## 來源\n- 雅虎財經：https://finance.yahoo.com/\n- 美國證券交易委員會（SEC）EDGAR：https://www.sec.gov/edgar\n- 晨星：https://www.morningstar.com/\n- 彭博社：https://www.bloomberg.com/\n- 路透社：https://www.reuters.com/\n\n（註：以上來源鏈接為示範，實際查詢時需確認具體網址。） ", "gate_rows": [{"doc": "20260205_Mizuho_Securities_MSFT_MSFT-_Good_Overall_Execution-_Albeit_with_More_Modest_Az.txt", "score": 0.003037552420367421, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "20260313_Barclays_MSFT_Microsoft_Corp.-_Evolving_AI_Offering_Brings_E7_to_Offic.txt", "score": 0.0007725969012862571, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "20260212_China_Renaissance_Research_MSFT_Microsoft_Corp_F2Q26_Review-_Progresses_in_Azure_and_b.txt", "score": 0.037917737083684254, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "20260205_Deutsche_Bank_MSFT_Microsoft-_F2Q_Leaning_into_the_long_game.txt", "score": 0.033822182007830784, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "Microsoft_Corp_Earnings_Call_2026128_RT000000003094331726.pdf.txt", "score": 0.17387734596623106, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "noise_e7", "score": 0.001588385238758316, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}], "ms": 6947.403375001159, "n_calls": 7, "usage": {"prompt": 2342, "completion": 436, "cached": 0}, "musd": 141.178}
